:{"hashtags":[{"indices":[0,6],"text":"陸上自衛隊"},{"indices":[40,44],"text":"ＷＰＳ"},{"indices":[45,67],"text":"WomenPeaceandSecurity"}],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIxMDA5MDI2NTY0NzQ3OTE5MzY=","text":"#陸上自衛隊 は、９月１５日から１７日の間、防衛省が主催する第３回日ＡＳＥＡＮ #ＷＰＳ(#WomenPeaceandSecurity)協力プロジェクトに参加しました。\n防衛省・自衛隊を含む各国取組紹介においては、陸自のジェンダー･アドバイザー等が災害現場に進出して被災者目線の支援に繋がる取組を紹介したほか、ＡＳＥＡＮやインド太平洋地域の国々からの発表や意見交換を通じて、様々な知見や経験を学ぶことができました。\nその後に実施した災害対応に係る机上検討においては、関係部隊等からの参加を得て直近の災害派遣の教訓を取り込みながら、被災者に寄り添った支援のあり方について議論を交わし、他の参加者とともにＷＰＳに係る理解を深めることができました。"}}},"rest_id":"2100902656516747338","source":"<a href=\"http://twitter.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter Web Client</a>","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"36333","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}},"user_id_str":"268732024"},"rest_id":"2100991663317627215","source":"<a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/download/ipad\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter for iPad</a>","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"4952","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2100991663317627215","sortIndex":"2101755047288242140"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":127},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1182494221720145920/1f6PGrY1_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/268732024/1693473523"},"core":{"created_at":"Sat Mar 19 10:39:03 +0000 2011","name":"防衛省・自衛隊","screen_name":"ModJapan_jp"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjoyNjg3MzIwMjQ=","is_blue_verified":true,"location":{"location":"東京都新宿区市谷本村町5-1"},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":true},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","pinned_items":{},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"profile_bio":{"description":"#防衛省・自衛隊 の公式アカウントです。防衛省の政策や各種活動などの最新情報を発信します。英語による発信▸ @ModJapan_en 災害派遣等の発信▸ @ModJapan_saigai 【Facebook】https://t.co/MhbTYVAO9J 【Instagram】 https://t.co/xfOJ2bbbiJ","entities":{"description":{"urls":[{"display_url":"facebook.com/mod.japn","expanded_url":"http://facebook.com/mod.japn","indices":[104,127],"url":"https://t.co/MhbTYVAO9J"},{"display_url":"Instagram.com/modjapan","expanded_url":"http://Instagram.com/modjapan","indices":[140,163],"url":"https://t.co/xfOJ2bbbiJ"}]},"url":{"urls":[{"display_url":"mod.go.jp","expanded_url":"https://www.mod.go.jp/","indices":[0,23],"url":"https://t.co/2xSIikAYYe"}]}}},"profile_description_language":"ja","profile_image_shape":"Circle","profile_metadata":{"profile_interstitial_type":""},"profile_translation":{"translator_type":"none"},"relationship_counts":{"followers":1264283,"following":43},"relationship_perspectives":{"blocked_by":false,"blocking":false,"followed_by":false,"following":false,"live_following":false,"muting":false},"rest_id":"268732024","super_follow_eligible":false,"super_followed_by":false,"super_following":false,"tweet_counts":{"media_tweets":7684,"tweets":21677},"verification":{"verified":false,"verified_type":"Government"},"website":{"url":"https://t.co/2xSIikAYYe"}}}},"edit_control":{"edit_tweet_ids":["2100991614881853857"],"editable_until_msecs":"1789754010181","edits_remaining":"5","is_edit_eligible":false},"grok_analysis_button":true,"grok_annotations":{},"grok_translated_post_with_availability":{"is_available":false},"is_translatable":false,"legacy":{"bookmark_count":0,"bookmarked":false,"conversation_id_str":"2100991614881853857","created_at":"Fri Sep 18 16:53:30 +0000 2026","display_text_range":[0,140],"entities":{"user_mentions":[{"id_str":"864751444586397696","indices":[3,16],"name":"防衛省統合幕僚監部","screen_name":"jointstaffpa"}]},"favorite_count":0,"favorited":false,"full_text":"RT @jointstaffpa: ９月１５日、白川統幕副長は、第３回　日ASEAN WPS協力プロジェクトに参加し、挨拶を述べました。また、９月１５日～１７日、統幕ジェンダーアドバイザー中田１空佐は、本プロジェクトにグループ討議の教官として参加しました。… https://t…","id_str":"2100991614881853857","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":39,"retweeted":false,"retweeted_status_result":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":3295},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1730044368902615040/7w8jWTpY_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/864751444586397696/1576143970"},"core":{"created_at":"Wed May 17 07:56:25 +0000 2017","name":"防衛省統合幕僚監部","screen_name":"jointstaffpa"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjo4NjQ3NTE0NDQ1ODYzOTc2OTY=","is_blue_verified":true,"location":{"location":"東京都新宿区"},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":true},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","pinned_items":{},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"profile_bio":{"description":"統合幕僚監部の公式アカウントです。陸・海・空自衛隊の運用を司る統合幕僚監部は、厳しさを増す安全保障環境の中、それぞれが行う我が国周辺の警戒監視・対領空侵犯措置、海外での任務（海賊対処行動など）、災害派遣、そしてあらゆる事態に備えての統合演習など統合幕僚監部ならではのプロフェッショナルな活動状況をお伝えしています。","entities":{"description":{},"url":{"urls":[{"display_url":"mod.go.jp/js/","expanded_url":"https://www.mod.go.jp/js/","indices":[0,23],"url":"https://t.co/Rh7kA16rwk"}]}}},"profile_description_language":"ja","profile_image_shape":"Circle","profile_metadata":{"profile_interstitial_type":""},"profile_translation":{"translator_type":"none"},"relationship_counts":{"followers":360650,"following":33},"relationship_perspectives":{"blocked_by":